            "paragraph": "In this study, we use GCAM model in its widely used version of 5.218 to match the same base year (2010) of climate outputs from 25 GCMs. Within GCAM, the world is divided into 32 energy-economic regions, simulating the equilibrium prices and quantities of various energy and GHG markets in each time period and in each region in five-year time steps from 2010 to 2100.",
